      "content": "What I understood you are asking for:\n1. \"Group the tumors into 2 to 5 subtypes by pathway mutation scores.\" -- not available here: no registered workflow produces this. Registered grouping puts each item in exactly one group (CONDOR: one community per regulator or gene; SAMBAR: one subtype per sample); none returns overlapping memberships.\n\nNo registered workflow produces this, so none is offered as the way to get it.\n\nNo files were inspected and no analysis ran."
    }
